  "description": "Heimdall OTLP/HTTP receiver: accepts OTLP traces/logs/metrics (protobuf + JSON) at /v1/* and writes them into IHeimdallSink. Pfad C — ingestion for stand-alone processes. HTTP-only (gRPC-frei für Einbetter); die OTLP-Message-Typen + OtlpConvert liegen in Heimdall.Otlp.Proto, die gRPC-Service-Stubs in Heimdall.Otlp.Grpc.",
